{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":41,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["上帝是以色列的幫助"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝說：「眾海島啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要在我面前安靜！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓眾民重新得力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓他們前來說話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓我們一起來理論。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「誰使一人從東方興起？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰憑公義把他召到跟前？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰把列國交給他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他征服列國的君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用刀將他們化為塵土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用弓驅散他們如風吹的碎稭？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他追趕他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安然走過從未踏足之路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰成就了這事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰從太初就決定各個世代？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我太初就在那裡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"末了也在那裡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「眾海島看見就害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地極也顫抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都上前來，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"彼此幫助，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"互相勉勵說，『要剛強！』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"工匠鼓勵金匠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打磨的勉勵打砧的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"談到銲接的說，『銲得好！』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們用釘子把偶像釘牢，免得搖晃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「然而，以色列啊，你是我的僕人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各啊，你是我揀選的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我朋友亞伯拉罕的後裔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把你從地極帶來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從遙遠的角落召來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我對你說，『你是我的僕人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我揀選了你，沒有丟棄你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不要害怕，因為我與你同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不要驚慌，因為我是你的上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必賜你力量，幫助你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用我公義的右手扶持你。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"「看啊，凡向你發怒的人必抱愧蒙羞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與你為敵的人都要滅亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歸於無有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你尋找與你相爭的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻找不到；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與你爭戰的人必歸於無有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我是你的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我拉著你的右手對你說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『不要怕，我必幫助你。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「蠕蟲雅各啊，以色列人啊，不要怕！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的救贖主——以色列的聖者耶和華說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我必幫助你。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我要使你成為一具簇新、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"帶許多利齒的打穀器。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要打碎高山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使丘陵碎如糠秕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要簸它們，讓風吹散它們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓狂風捲走它們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你要以耶和華為喜樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以以色列的聖者為榮耀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「貧窮困苦的人找不到水喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們口乾舌燥。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我耶和華必應允他們的呼求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我，以色列的上帝不會撇棄他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使光禿的山嶺上江河奔流，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山谷中泉水湧流；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使沙漠變成水塘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使乾地冒出泉水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在曠野栽種香柏樹、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"皂莢樹、番石榴樹和橄欖樹。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在沙漠種松樹、杉樹和黃楊樹，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好讓人一看就知道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一想就明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華親手所為，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是以色列的聖者創造的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"耶和華對偶像說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「陳明你們的主張吧。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各的王說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「擺出你們的證據吧。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"告訴我們將要發生的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"告訴我們以前發生的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好思想並明白事情的結局。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向我們宣告將來的事，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"告訴我們以後會發生什麼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫我們知道你們是神明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不論降福降禍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫我們一同驚懼！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你們實在算不得什麼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們所做的毫無意義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"選擇你們的人真是可憎！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"「我使一人從北方興起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他來了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在東方求告我的名。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必把掌權者像灰泥一樣踏在腳下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像窯匠踩泥一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰從太初就宣告這事，讓我們知道呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰預先講明這事，讓我們說他是對的呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰也沒有宣告過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰也沒有預言過，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰也沒有聽見你們說什麼。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我首先告訴錫安的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我給耶路撒冷一個報好消息的使者。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我看了看，沒有一個出謀劃策的。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我問話，沒有一個回答。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，偶像全是假的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"毫無作為，鑄像虛空如風。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/41.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/42.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/40.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":29}